Parking Lot Design
Requirement Gathering
1. Parking lot should support parking of vehicles.
2. Parking lot should support parking of different vehicle types.
3. Parking lot should have multiple floors.
4. Each floor should have multiple parking spots.
5. A parking spot should accept only a particular vehicle type.
6. Parking lot should have multiple entry and exit gates.
7. Parking lot should support multiple pricing strategies (Time-based, Event-based, etc.).
8. Customers should be able to pay tickets using multiple payment modes (Card, Cash, UPI, etc.).
9. No two vehicles should get the same parking spot at the same time.
